### Create task — full body
POST {{host}}/api/v1/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Kup mleko",
  "description": "2 litry",
  "dueDate": "2026-10-29",
  "priority": "MEDIUM"
}

### Create task — minimal (only required fields)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Zrób zadanie",
  "priority": "HIGH"
}

### Create task — validation error (empty title)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "priority": "LOW"
}

### List tasks
GET {{host}}/api/v1/tasks

### Delete task
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/tasks/{{taskId}}

### Update task
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/tasks/{{taskId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Kup mleko (updated)",
  "description": "2 litry",
  "dueDate": "2026-10-30",
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "status": "OPEN"
}
